hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1799","Umm al-Mu’minin Aisha Siddiqa (may Allah be pleased with her) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: “Whoever is called to account on the Day of Resurrection will be ruined.” (The rest of the hadith has already been mentioned in the Book of Knowledge, under the chapter: Whoever heard something and did not understand it, then asked again so that he might understand...)"
"1800","`Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with them both) said that` ""by 'step by step' is meant the changing of conditions one after another,"" and this was stated by the Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) himself."
